<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Acesita starts as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Acesita starts as neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura Research said on Friday analyst Steven Assis had started coverage of Brazilian steelmaker Companhia Acos Especiais Itabira, or Acesita, with a rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a Feb 13 analysis, Assis wrote, &quot;Overall, we believe the company has a solid long-term strategy in specialty steel, but we prefer to wait for a brighter short-term scenario to recommend purchase of this stock.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Acesita's shares were off 0.10 real to 2.95 in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
